 "srcS": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/Pennsylvania/Old-Bedford-Historical-Village/OBV-Fall-Cowboys-25/i-CcZtSGv/0/Nhd6nRbwCb2ckjkqnst7Khwb48gDH6PxXvQpVLNxh/S/_HF20212-1229-S.jpg",
